## Project
Uzum Marketplace Collector userscript.js — Tampermonkey userscript running on `uzum.uz` — collects the full product catalog (~248K products across ~1.6K leaf categories) into IndexedDB and exports as JSONL.

## Behavior

- **Collection**: parallel-scans all leaf categories via GraphQL query.
- **Resume**: saves progress to IndexedDB `cat_totals`. Restart from a stopped state.
- **Refresh**: checks current totals for all categories, deep-scans those where totals changed or weren't fully collected.
- **Rate limit**: 429 responses trigger a 2s retry. 3 consecutive failures on a category skips it.
- **Offset limit**: GraphQL rejects offsets >= 9951 (batch of 48) or 9901 (batch of 100). Categories >10K items (~3 exist: Makiyaj 21K, Psixologiya 19K, Badiiy adabiyot 15K) are truncated.

## Session Context (2026-07-25)

- Browser open at `uzum.uz`.
- Connected via Chrome DevTools MCP + Tampermonkey MCP.
- 248,668 products collected. 652 leaf categories.
- ~85 categories fail at offset 0 (likely auth-restricted categories: food, cosmetics, adult, pharmacy) — they return `total` but never any items.
- ~18 categories fail mid-scan (offset > 0) — partial data collected.
